(Sihanoukville): ASEAN has noted that Russia is the third market source for ASEAN tourism destinations, which is why ASEAN has approved the tourism action plan between ASEAN and the Russian Federation 2022-2024, especially after the announcement of tourism in the ASEAN region. Repeat.
The ASEAN-Russia Tourism Ministers' Meeting noted that tourism revenue between ASEAN and Russia decreased by about 37% compared to 2020 and noted that Russia was the third largest market source for ASEAN tourism destinations.
The meeting also approved the ASEAN-Russia Tourism Action Plan 2022-2024, which focuses on strengthening ASEAN-Russia cooperation on tourism, prioritizing the restoration of ASEAN-Russia tourism.
