Spokesman for the General Commission: 615 more vehicles were inspected and fined on January 20, 2022
According to the spokesperson, as of January 20, 2022, traffic police nationwide inspected and fined a total of 13,219 vehicles, including 9,952 motorcycles and 3,267 vehicles.
Notable offenses for motorcycles are mostly without helmets, offenses, overcrowding and no license plates. In particular, the car violated the speed, violated the sign, no driver's license, no license plate, over capacity, no business belt, etc.
It should be noted that for January 20, 2022, there were 15 traffic accidents throughout Cambodia, in which 8 people were killed and 21 injured (19 seriously injured). In the past 20 days, there have been 223 traffic accidents, resulting in 121 deaths, 290 injuries (200 seriously injured).
The Ministry of Interior requested that Prince Chakravuth make internal coordination to organize a congress to elect the party's leadership in accordance with the statute
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Interior has requested that Prince Norodom Chakravuth, Vice President of FUNCINPEC, form an internal party coordination to organize a congress to elect the party's leadership in accordance with the statute. This is according to the letter of Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior, sent to Prince Chakrawuth, which was received by Fresh News on January 20, 2022.
In this letter, Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng confirmed that the Ministry of Interior has already received Resolution No. 045 HOP dated 16 December 2020 of FUNCINPEC Party appointing Prince Norodom Chakravuth as Vice President of FUNCINPEC in accordance with 59 New party statutes.
"Therefore, the Ministry of Interior requests the Prince to coordinate within the party to organize a congress to select the party's leadership in accordance with the content of Article 16, Article 17, Article 19, Article 20, Article 24 and Article 35 of the party's statute, kept at the Ministry of Interior. Area as well as the provisions of the new Article 18 of the Law on Political Parties. This is according to the letter of Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng.
