President of C & S Med Cleaning Company sued by clients for fraudulent non-performance
(Phnom Penh): Some customers have decided to file a formal lawsuit against Mr. Khim Lahn, a representative and chairman of the Board of Directors of C&S Meditation Cleaning Company, in connection with the fraudulent non-fulfillment of customer obligations.
According to the victim's complaint, which was received by Fresh News today, the complaint has already been submitted to the Po Sen Chey district police inspector, who has already summoned Khim Lahn, but Khim Lahn Did not appear as summoned by the district authorities.
In the complaint of the victim who sued Mr. Khim Lahn related to the following offenses:
* First: Fraud does not fulfill the obligation to provide employees with the same qualifications as advertised and agreed upon in the contract. * Second: the use of minors to work. * Third: Failure to fulfill the obligation to send employees to work in the craft as specified in the contract. In the past, clients have also filed a lawsuit against Mr. Khim Lahn to the President of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court.
