(Phnom Penh): The Deputy Secretary General of the National Committee for Clean City Assessment (NCPC) and the Governor of Chamkar Mon District on the morning of January 20, 2022, held a meeting to verify and evaluate the movement of the Clean City Competition. 3 of Chamkarmon district candidates.
