The district governor also requested the working group and the secretariat to promote all the work related to the application to participate in the clean city competition according to the standard, which currently has 7 clean city indicators, 41 basic indicators, detailed indicators and 113 criteria. In order for the district to receive 3 prizes in the Clean City Competition for 2022-2025.
