(Pursat): Mr. Chiao Tai, Provincial Governor and Chairman of the Committee for the 19-Kovid Vaccination in Pursat Province, on January 20, 2022, launched the Kovid 19 Vaccine Campaign (MOD) for 1,496 front-line civil servants, equivalent to 30 departments and units in Pursat province.
He also called on all government officials, the armed forces and the people of Pursat to come and receive the booster dose (3rd and 4th) in accordance with the efforts of the Royal Government to find the vaccine. Come and play all over the country now.
