On that occasion, the Election Team and the Executive Committee of FUNCINPEC in Siem Reap and members at all levels throughout the province committed to support the procession under the leadership of Norodom Chakravuth, President of FUNCINPEC to succeed his father. Norodom Ranariddh's group to live forever in the election with the potential for success in the future.
