* Samdech Techo Hun Sen welcomes the participation of all national and international guests
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that it has been two years since the 19-crisis Kovid crisis has adversely affected tourism
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says Cambodia is pleased that the country has reopened
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says that in Cambodia, many tourism businesses have been suspended, many tourism workers have lost their jobs due to Kovid 19
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says, however, that the Royal Government has effectively controlled the spread of Kovid 19
