* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces support for reopening ASEAN intra-tourism
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces support for vaccine tourism in ASEAN
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says that for the past two years, each country has put in place separate measures to combat Kovid 19
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen considers that this separate measure has seriously affected trade and tourism
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the previous stage was the stage where we did not have enough vaccines, but this stage is the stage of vaccination as a step of mutual recognition.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praises Thailand for working with Cambodia to allow people to be vaccinated against each other without having to be vaccinated.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen recalled his previous remarks that within the framework of ASEAN, those who have not been vaccinated will not be able to travel.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen wants the priority of ASEAN affairs in 2022 to continue the fight against Kovid 19 and reopen with the opening of travel corridors for tourism
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says ASEAN's work in 2022 is not just about Myanmar
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says we have a lot of work to do besides Myanmar and ASEAN is not a hostage to Myanmar
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen is pleased that the ASEAN Secretary-General has met with various political partners in Cambodia and worked well together.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen confirms that the ASEAN agenda for 2022 is not only a Myanmar issue, but also many issues, including the issue of Kovid 19
