(Rattanakiri): The Ratanakkiri Provincial Land Management Committee reviewed the draft land use master plan in Ta Veng, Andong Meas and O'Yadao districts on the morning of January 18, 2022 in the presence of Mr. Nhem Sam Oeun, Provincial Governor and Chairman of the Management Committee. Provincial state land.
In this meeting, the provincial governor urged the technical working groups to prepare land use plans for the three districts in cooperation with relevant stakeholders to expedite and comprehensively expedite the basic technical standards and laws to submit to the Land Management Committee and District and provincial urban planning to submit for decision from the Ministry of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction for review and decision.
The provincial governor added that all land titles and other developments in each district must be in accordance with the master plan that was reviewed and revised in the current meeting until the use of land use master plan in All three districts are official.
