In a recent meeting, Dr. Sok Sokretya said that during the meeting, he learned about the use of digital systems and intended to bring this modern technology to the tourism industry in Cambodia. Coming soon. According to the leading Thai company Bitkub, the use of digital for business is easy and efficient.
