General Department of Taxation Holds Inter-Ministerial Meeting to Review and Discuss Draft Law on Tax
(Phnom Penh): The General Department of Taxation organized an inter-ministerial meeting to review and discuss the draft law on tax on January 14, 2022.
This draft law on taxation is designed to compile a number of tax laws and regulations that are fragmented and have been developed for nearly four decades to be more concentrated and consistent to ensure more consistent implementation. Smooth and easy to study and understand.
This arrangement also aims to respond to the international excellence of Cambodia's economic integration in the region and the world in line with the development of society, national and international economy and the development of information technology in the digital age.
