Five suspects arrested in Sihanoukville after burglary and looting of property
(Preah Sihanouk): A group of thieves robbed motorbikes and looted the property of the people in Sihanoukville, Preah Sihanouk Province, and were cracked down on by 5 out of 9 gang members. In front of the police, the suspect confessed that he had acted in Sihanoukville, Phnom Penh and Kampot a total of 19 times.
Preah Sihanouk Provincial Police Commissioner Major General Chuon Narin told Fresh News on January 14, 2022 that the suspects had kicked a motorbike, beaten it with a sword, a machete and a machete. And robbing motorbikes and valuables of people traveling on public roads.
It was caused by an unidentified suspect, 5 people riding 2 motorcycles, kicking the motorcycle of the people while the victim was riding a motorcycle on the road with a man driving a motorcycle and a woman. As a lover riding behind caused injuries, then the suspects used swords, knives, iron rods to cut and beat the victim more, robbed a motorcycle and robbed a backpack with a mobile phone 2 units and some other materials.
In this incident, the first victim was injured: Tat Phatra, 23 years old, an employee of Vimean Khsach Sar Casino Company, resides in Village 4, Sangkat 4, Sihanoukville, with a broken left finger and knee, and the second: Name: Prak Chandalin, Female, 20 years old, Occupation: Casino employee, Residence: Village 2, Sangkat 3, Preah Sihanouk City, Injured nose, mouth, left arm and left leg
Immediately after receiving this information, the Criminal Police Planning Task Force cooperated with the Sihanoukville Police Inspectorate, Prey Nup District Police Inspectorate, Kampong Seila District Police Inspectorate and Stung Hav District Police Inspectorate. Road straight to the main point to intercept the suspect.
Until 9:15 pm, 4 suspects were intercepted at the intersection of National Road 4, Prey Nob District, Preah Sihanouk Province, while another suspect abandoned his motorcycle and fled into the forest. Missing. Authorities continued their search until 3:20 a.m. on January 11, 2022, when they arrested another suspect.
During the operation, the police arrested a total of 5 suspects, while the suspects who escaped and some of the suspects' accomplices, our police are searching for arrests.
After interrogation, the suspects confessed that their accomplices who kicked the motorcycle and used a sword, a machete, a machete and a hijacker, as well as a total of 9 people, were arrested by the police. Detained 5 people.
They also confessed to having acted in eight cases in Sihanoukville, five in Kampot and six in Phnom Penh, while in Takeo there was an arrest warrant issued by the Takeo Provincial Court. . For the above suspects, the light criminal police office is building a case to be sent to the Sihanoukville Provincial Court for legal action. Separately, the accomplices of the suspects who escaped are continuing to search for arrests.
