Dr. Phon Narin, Director of ACLEDA Business Institute, said that this collaboration will help the two institutes to ensure the sustainability and effectiveness of cooperation between the two sides in organizing general Chinese language training for students and The general public.
The Director of ACLEDA Business Institute emphasized that Chinese is a popular language in the labor market in Cambodia, in the region and around the world.
