He said that the Institute is honored to receive the approval of the Royal Academy of Cambodia at the request of the Institute on Cooperation and Support for General Chinese Language Training Services between the Confucius Institute of the Royal Academy of Cambodia and the ACLEDA Business Institute.
In addition, Dr. Phon Narin stated that the Institute is looking for potential partners and new skills to develop knowledge of the general Chinese language and improve the curriculum in the educational services of the Institute to be up-to-date.
Understand that ACLEDA Business Institute provides quality education and training services: Higher education and postgraduate education: Master's degree, specialization: Finance and Banking, Finance, Management.
