Tbong Khmum Provincial Administration Holds the 32nd Ordinary Meeting of the Third Mandate of the Provincial Council to Review and Approve the Work of the Annual Report 2021
(Tbong Khmum): The administration of Tbong Khmum province on the morning of January 11, 2022, held the 32nd Ordinary Meeting of the third mandate of the Provincial Council to review and approve the work of the annual report for 2021.
The meeting was chaired by Mr. Seak Leng, Chairman of Tbong Khmum Provincial Council and Dr. Cheam Chansophoan, Governor of Tbong Khmum Provincial Board of Governors. - Deputy Director of the Provincial Office, Chairman of the OWSO, Chairman of the Provincial Hall, Chairman - Deputy Director of Departments around the province and some stakeholders.
The meeting raised a number of agendas, reviewed and approved the draft report, including: Draft Minutes of the 32nd Ordinary Meeting of the 3rd Mandate of the Provincial Council, Draft Annual Progress Report 2021 of Provincial Administration, Draft 3-Month Action Plan (January, February, March) 2022 of the Provincial Administration, Draft Incentive Plan for 2021 Civil Servants and other issues.
Mr. Seng Chey Vuth, Deputy Director of Administration of Tbong Khmum Provincial Hall, read the draft report and draft minutes to the meeting for joint discussion and then approved by 25 out of 25 votes.
At the same time, Dr. Cheam Chansophoan also praised and highly appreciated all stakeholders who have worked hard in the past, especially in the provincial council, which helped to promote the work of the administration of Tbong Khmum to achieve good results. Subsequently.
Dr. Governor also urged the relevant departments around the province to cooperate with the technical team to prepare a complete and accurate report document before submitting to the meeting to review both ordinary and extraordinary meetings of the provincial council.
