According to the planned plan, the mission in the Kovid-19 vaccination campaign for the people of Siem Reap from the age of 18 and from the age of 12 to under 18 is carried out by a team of civil doctors for 14 days. In 22 locations throughout the province, such as provincial referral hospitals, OD referral hospitals and health centers.
During the same campaign, vaccinations for the people of Siem Reap from the age of 18 by the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces (RCAF) doctors lasted for 10 days in 42 locations, including pagodas, schools and commune halls. Overall, throughout the campaign, both the missions of civilian and military medics were carried out in 64 locations.
