The location for the statue of the Buddha should be established to worship in four places: 1: To show the prosperity of Buddhism in Myanmar to the world, 2: To ensure peace and stability in the state, 3: To create a growth of local people to visit by national and international pilgrims; and 4: Facilitate national development.
