The Senate issued a press release on the results of the 8th session of the 4th legislature (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): The Senate issued a press release on the results of the 8th session of the 4th legislature held this morning. On January 6, 2022, which was presided over by Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum, President of the Senate of Cambodia, with 58 senators present.
In a press release issued by the General Secretariat of the Senate, Fresh News stated that the meeting approved six agendas, including:
First, to hear the report of the Standing Committee on the activities and results of the Senate between the 7th and 8th sessions of the 4th Senate.
Second, the announcement of the recognition of the new senator for the fourth term in place of the late Ms. O Sokhom.
Third: The election of members of the Economic, Financial, Banking and Audit Committee of the Senate for the fourth term.
Fourth, review and comment on the draft law on the amendment of the law on commercial enterprises.
Fifth, review and comment on the draft law on the amendment of the law on trade rules and business registration.
And 6: Review and comment on the draft law on the approval of the Free Trade Agreement between the Royal Government of the Kingdom of Cambodia and the Government of the Republic of Korea.
