* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that yesterday, Cambodia found 19 cases of Kovid 19 virus as an import and as an omega-3 virus.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that people with the new virus omega city are not allowed to be treated at home.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that it is not allowed to intervene for people with new metabolic virus omega at home.
