Two men electrocuted to death in Sangkat Rokar Kandal, Kratie City
(Kratie): Two men died in the lake due to electric shock while trying to connect the fish in the lake, but unfortunately accidentally shocked themselves. The body was found on January 4, 2022 at Boeung Romleach, Rokar Kandal Village, Sangkat Rokar Kandal, Kratie City.
According to the Kratie City Police report, on January 2, 2022, between 3 o'clock, an electric shock occurred at the above location, killing two people named Men Sarun, age 36-year-old resides in Village 2, Sangkat Rokar Kandal, Kratie City, Kratie Province, and Sim Kong, 27 years old, resides in Village 2, Sangkat Rokar Kandal, Kratie City, Kratie Province.
According to the report, after receiving the information on the morning of January 4, 2022, the competent experts in cooperation with local authorities went to the scene to examine the body and gather information around the scene, claiming that the two brought They took an electric shock device to shock the fish at the scene and were electrocuted, killing both of them.
It should be noted that in Kratie province, it is observed that the crime of catching fish has increased and the people have requested the competent authorities to cooperate with the fisheries officials to crack down on various devices that can be assembled as fishing gear for sale in the market, but no action has been taken yet. That is not the case.
The Ministry of Foreign Affairs unveiled the symbol for use at the ASEAN Summit, which Cambodia will host in 2022 (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation of Cambodia on Tuesday unveiled the symbol for use. In the upcoming ASEAN Summit and related meetings that Cambodia will host in 2022.
Cambodia will be chairing ASEAN throughout 2022. As the chair of ASEAN in 2022, the Royal Government of Cambodia has chosen the theme "ASEAN works together: solve all challenges together."
As for the symbol, the lotus form is a form of Khmer art that represents the prosperity and harmony of peace that the 10 ASEAN member countries have strived to create. The three colors on its layer are derived from the colors of the Cambodian flag, while gold represents the colors and diversity of ASEAN.
The core spirit of ASEAN 2022 is unity, solidarity and harmony, and the main objective is to maintain ASEAN's centrality and solidarity, jointly address challenges, ensure the progress of existing common work, and promote a focus on humanity. .
With the start of its chairmanship of ASEAN in 2022, Cambodia expects results such as: Joint Statement and Statement by ASEAN Leaders, Continuation of Work Plan and Action Plan, as well as the organization of key events and activities. All.
