According to the decision received by Fresh News on the evening of January 4, 2022, the Secretariat of the ASEAN Intergovernmental Commission on Human Rights in Cambodia (ACHA-Cambodia) has Mr. Chin Malin, Vice Chairman The Cambodian Human Rights Committee is chaired by the Vice-Chairman and has a total of 15 members, divided into two sections: First: General Affairs, Finance and Protocol, and second: Content.
The Secretariat of the ASEAN Intergovernmental Commission on Human Rights in Cambodia (ACHA-Cambodia) is responsible for coordinating the work, content, general affairs, administration, finance and protocol for the Cambodian Representative to the ASEAN Intergovernmental Commission on Human Rights to ensure the work of The Cambodian Commission on the ASEAN Intergovernmental Commission on Human Rights operates smoothly and effectively.
Please be informed that the Royal Government of Cambodia has decided to appoint Mr. Keo Remy, Chairman of the Cambodian Human Rights Committee, as the Cambodian Representative to the ASEAN Intergovernmental Commission on Human Rights (ICHA) for the fifth mandate in 2022-2024 and in the coming 2022. Cambodia will chair Aisha, which may have a number of politically sensitive issues to be discussed at the meeting.
