Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated: "Now I would like to tell the provincial governor to dare to do that again, the provincial governor must be responsible to the Royal Government, otherwise the Ly Chhuong company, like the eel company, he will go everywhere." "The request came to me, I did not agree, it was not time for him to visit the province, now the province owes a lot of money, but I have issued an order, but lest the order be late."
Samdech Techo Hun Sen's order came after he received a report from the Minister of Economy and Finance regarding the debts owed by the provinces to Ly Chhuong Company through a pre-construction contract and then paid later without going through a bidding process. .
Samdech Techo ordered the provincial governors to remove all projects that have not yet been implemented, even after signing with Ly Chhuong or other companies, to clear the list and the money owed to Ly Chhuong must be paid within 20 days. Years.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in this case, the company and the provincial governor had conspired without going through the bidding and demanded that the Royal Government pay, as the provincial governors did not ask the Royal Government to request the construction. Those are not. Samdech Techo Hun Sen also instructed the Ly Chhuong company to stop immediately, otherwise Samdech will blacklist the company.
Ly Chhuong is a large company that built the Peace Palace and the National Assembly, as well as many other buildings.
Samdech also warned all companies not to follow the example of Ly Chhuong. Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that Vietnam and Laos suffered for many years because of such debt problems, he gave too much power to the provincial administration.
Samdech confirmed that "I used to gamble, the game is done before the payment, after we wait to pay off their debts and take time." Samdech Techo Hun Sen confirmed that now the national level has already paid off this debt, but the provincial level to play this dangerous game. Samdech also warned that if such a construction contract is signed by the former provincial governor, the former provincial governor must also be called in to pay.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen continued that every action must seek the approval of the Royal Government, Samdech continued that the province has been given power, but that power has been misused
Samdech told Ly Chhuong to borrow money from the bank to solve his problem. Samdech further stated that Samdech has not yet ordered an audit, if Samdech ordered an audit, the provincial governor may be removed from office, but Samdech did not choose the strict level.
Samdech explained that only the Ministry of Economy and Finance represents the Royal Government, while the provincial administration follows the pre-payment method, which is a loan that the Royal Government does not allow. Nearly 24 kg of drugs and a Vietnamese man were raided in Chroy Changva district
