On that occasion, he added that any person has the right to file a complaint and / or objection in writing on Form 1202 regarding the initial voter list and the list of persons to be removed from the voter list to the Commune / Sangkat Council. 10 days at the latest after posting. The initial voter list and the list of those to be removed from the voter list will also be posted on the NEC website.
