Boeung Chungrok Techo Victory Village Celebrates 23rd Anniversary of Win-Win Politics
(Banteay Meanchey): December 29 is an unforgettable historical day for the Cambodian nation because it is the day that Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, used his life as capital to unite the nation. Full national unity through the implementation of win-win politics to end the long civil war in Cambodia brings peace and development to the nation and the people of Cambodia.
In commemoration of the 23rd anniversary of the win-win politics on Wednesday, March 10, 2521, which is December 29, 2021 in Boeung Chhongrok village, Techo won, Tuol Pong commune, Malai district, province. Banteay Meanchey celebrates the 23rd anniversary of the win-win politics of Prime Minister Samdech Hun Sen.
Mr. Tep Khun Nal, Advisor to the Prime Minister and Mr. Chhim Bunny, Chairman of the Malai District Council, introduced the historical facts of the story of the Khmer Rouge soldiers' separatist movement leading to integration with the Royal Government. By the Cambodian People's Party, according to the win-win political principles of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister, which has ensured the following three main security:
1. Ensuring the personal security of individuals and families who volunteer to end wars and battles and return to the core of society.
2. Ensuring occupational safety by providing them with sufficient opportunities to continue their careers and livelihoods.
3. Ensuring the security of the property they have owned and occupied in the past without confiscation or dismantling. These are the dharmas and concessions of the philosophy of peace that are part of the strategy to end the civil war, the strategy against guerrilla warfare or the insurgency, and this strategy has continued to be very effective in taking preventive and repressive measures.
Achievements, Infrastructure and Boeng Chungrok Techo Win Village as a whole is another new bond between Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen to the people on the occasion of celebrating the 23rd anniversary of Victory Politics On December 29, 2021, in Boeung Chhongrok village, Techo Chana Chhnang also held a ceremony to hand over 9 Techo Chan Chhnang houses to 9 village elders.
