* Evaluation of the qualifications of natural persons and legal entities who have carried out outstanding environmental friendly activities based on the evaluation table of the qualifications of natural persons and legal entities of environmental friendliness.
Operators are made with high responsibility, accuracy, transparency and accountability.
* The Department of Environment of the Capital and Provinces shall prepare a request to provide a certificate of environmental friendliness to the Ministry of Environment every quarter.
The Rewards and Incentives Department shall coordinate and provide guidance in the process of evaluating the qualifications for the implementation of environmental friendliness. The Department of Rewards and Incentives shall verify the results of the evaluation of the qualifications of the Department of Environment of the Capital and Provinces in order to prepare a certificate of environmental friendliness of the Ministry of Environment.
