The presentation of the concept of the ASEAN Symbol 2022 took place on the occasion of the Ministry of Information and Information on the Priorities of Cambodia as the Chair of ASEAN 2022 to the diplomats and the media under the chairmanship of Deputy Prime Minister Prak Sokhon, Minister of Foreign Affairs and National Representative. For the ASEAN Security-Political Community Council.
The concept of the ASEAN Symbol 2022 includes:
2. The blue color of the six layers of lotus represents peace, stability, trust, confidence, solidarity and cooperation, which are the main aspirations of ASEAN.
3: The red color of the four layers of lotus represents the life, well-being, courage and energy of ASEAN.
4. The Golden Circle represents the greatness, success, achievement and success in the process of building the ASEAN Community and the spirit of unity and unity of ASEAN.
5. Diversity represents the diversity of the 10 ASEAN member countries.
Please be informed that the theme that Cambodia set out during its chairmanship of ASEAN in 2022 is "ASEAN working together to solve common challenges". The Cambodian head of diplomacy explained that the idea was to demonstrate the importance of the spirit of ASEAN as a united family, and that this strong sense of solidarity was in working together to achieve a common goal.
