This morning, the Ministry of National Defense held a ceremony at the Victory Monument to celebrate the 23rd anniversary of Samdech Techo Hun Sen's Victory Day.
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of National Defense of Cambodia celebrates the Victory Monument from December 30 to celebrate the 23rd anniversary (December 29, 1998 - December 29, 2021) of the end of the war in Cambodia under the policy of victory Win and the third anniversary of the opening of the Victory Monument in Sangkat Prek Ta Sek, Khan Chroy Changva, north of Phnom Penh.
