Along with this heavy burden, the provincial administration and the provincial Red Cross branch have launched a series of visits and helped solve all these concerns. In fact, today, the Provincial Red Cross Branch brought humanitarian donations in the form of food and some money to give to 41 vulnerable families to continue to survive and eat for a while.
