This intention was expressed through a representative of the Turkish Embassy in Cambodia at a press conference on the ASEAN Chairmanship of Cambodia 2022, organized by the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation on the afternoon of December 29, 2021.
Responding to a question from a Turkish embassy representative, Deputy Prime Minister Prak Sokhon, Minister of Foreign Affairs, expressed hope that what Turkey wanted was possible in the future "but will have to wait for consensus in principle".
In front of the relevant ministries / institutions, representatives of embassies in Cambodia and many journalists, the head of diplomacy stated, "I hope it will be possible in the future."
