Khmer Kampuchea Krom Association claims that Mr. Sok Sovann Vathana Sabung is not Khmer Kampuchea Krom
(Phnom Penh): The Khmer Kampuchea Krom Association, an organization working to protect the Khmer Kampuchea Krom living in Cambodia, has come out to claim that Mr. Sok Sovann Vathanasabung, President of the Khmer Rouge Party and accused of robbing tycoon An Sieu Mey, is not Khmer. Kampuchea Krom.
The confirmation of the Khmer Kampuchea Krom Association came after some media outlets reported that Mr. Sok Sovann Vathana Sabung, also known as William Gang, was the Khmer Kampuchea Krom.
In a press release on December 29, 2021, the Khmer Kampuchea Krom Association stated that according to its thorough research, there was no sign that Mr. Sok Sovann Vathana Sabung had a background related to Hometown in the territory of Kampuchea Krom. In addition, according to the interview of Mr. Sok Sovann Vathana Sabung directly with the authorities also confirmed that he was born in Battambang province.
Therefore, the Secretariat of the Khmer Kampuchea Krom Association in the Kingdom of Cambodia, which has nine members of the Khmer Kampuchea Krom Association, would like to make the following press release:
While claiming that Mr. Sok Sovann Vathana Sabung was not a Khmer Kampuchea Krom, the Khmer Kampuchea Krom Association requested that any media outlet that Mr. Sok Sovann Vathana Sabung was born in Kampuchea Krom be corrected. As it should be.
However, the Khmer Kampuchea Krom Association is waiting for arguments from the media as well, if those media have clear evidence that Mr. Sok Sovann Vathana Sabung is Khmer Kampuchea Krom.
It should be noted that Mr. Sok Sovann Vathanasabong, alias William Gang, President of the Khmer Rouge Party, was arrested by the Phnom Penh Municipal Gendarmerie along with some other factions after it was discovered that they had robbed Duke An Seavmey on December 19, 2021 ago.
On December 26, 2021, the Investigating Judge of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court, Mr. Yan Sopheap, issued an order to bring the mastermind of the robbery, Mr. Sok Sovann Vathana Sabung, and his accomplices involved in the robbery case to Prey Sar Prison to await Waiting for trial later.
