(Kampong Cham): Mr. Un Chanda, Governor of Kampong Cham Province, this morning, December 29, 2021, chaired a meeting with the municipal authorities and relevant departments to discuss the draft property price for the basis of stamp duty in the province. Held at Kampong Cham Tax Branch.
The meeting was held in accordance with the letter No. 12242 dated October 20, 2021 of the General Department of Taxation of the Ministry of Economy and Finance and discussed for four purposes, including:
* First, to collect stamp duty, transfer of ownership or possession of real estate effectively, transparently and equitably.
* Second: Examine the annex currently implemented to determine the basis for stamp duty in Kampong Cham, lest there be any gaps related to the volatility of real estate prices.
* Third: To review and discuss on the draft of the new real estate, the new annex of the new geographical distribution of real estate values, as the basis for stamp duty in Kampong Cham province.
* Fourth: After the meeting, the provincial tax branch will prepare a letter and submit it to the Real Estate Appraisal Committee at the General Department of Taxation.
