I hope that Mr. Sam Rainsy will not send the same message as before, asking not to swear or bet like a child. Because this child no longer believes in the old politicians who talk on the palms of their hands or use the white-eared strategy. I hope that the old politicians like Mr. Sam Rainsy must have the courage to defend their arguments. Mentioned in public again and again to attack the younger generation like me.
Sam Rainsy has been attacking my father for decades, but he has not been able to move forward. Now turn to attack me, the younger generation. If you do too much, please show courage, do not let children underestimate the elderly, but do not have the courage to take responsibility for what they say or do. Either way, he is older than my father and should not be tarnished in front of the younger generation.
As a moral and virtuous life, I always respect the elders. But if an older person is older and works irresponsibly, especially attacking me baselessly, then I have no choice but to defend my honor and dignity. Do not accuse me of not knowing the elders. ”
