At the meeting to end the old year and launch the work plan for the new year, the People's Bank of China also said that it will take measures to manage capital companies and private fund companies and implement a management system for real estate financing. .
Debt crises for large real estate developers have hit the real estate sector, which is crucial to China's economic growth.
"A prudent monetary policy is flexible, reasonable and appropriate," Reuters quoted the central bank as saying.
The central bank said in a statement on its website: "The central bank will effectively bear the responsibility for maintaining macroeconomic stability and launch a prudent monetary and fiscal policy. "Promote economic stability."
The People's Bank of China said it also intends to increase the volatility of the Chinese currency while keeping the value of the currency stable, reasonable and balanced. According to Reuters.
