BEIJING (Reuters) - US politicians have recently been foolishly propagandizing China's human rights record. From the fabrication of the so-called Xinjiang draft law to the appointment of the so-called "Special Coordinator for Xizang Regional Affairs", the US side has interfered in China's internal affairs under the pretext of "human rights". Seriously undermines international order and the basic code of international relations.
According to a report released by the Chinese Association for the Study of Human Rights on December 27, the US side has turned human rights issues into a serious political issue in the field of international human rights, posing a serious threat to The development of global human rights will have dire consequences.
Many facts prove that human rights are not only a cover for American hegemony, but also a huge stick and political tool for cracking down on other American countries. The sole purpose of the US Government to raise the human rights flag is to use human rights issues to promote its global strategy.
The United States has turned human rights issues into a political issue, seriously undermining the human rights ideology and severely affecting global human rights governance, and also undermining American-style hegemony.
(Svay Rieng): The case of stabbing a Chinese woman in Dangkor district, the force of the Criminal Police Department led a joint investigation to crack down on the perpetrators in Romeas Hek district, Svay Rieng province at noon on December 28, 2021. The murder of a Chinese woman happened on the night of December 25, 2021 at the Koul Den Grace factory in Anlong Kong Thmey village, Sangkat Prey Sar, Khan Dangkor, Phnom Penh.
The operation was carried out under the command of General Dr. Neth Savoeun, National Police Commissioner, Lt. Gen. In Bora, Deputy Commissioner for Planning, and Lt. Gen. Neng Chuor, Director of the Criminal Police Department. The Criminal Police Force is led by Colonel Kheng Meng Chheang, Director of the Bureau of Minor Offenses, in collaboration with the Dangkor District Police Inspectorate and the Svay Rieng Provincial Police.
Authorities confirmed that on the day of the incident, the victim and the suspect had an argument in rooms 8 and 9 in the factory and also remained quiet until late at night, the suspect and the Chinese who worked together. In the factory, returning from drinking, entering the factory, suddenly the suspect had a conflict with the victim for the second time, with a fight with each other.
The suspect then pulled out a knife and stabbed the victim in the back, causing the victim to be seriously injured. The factory owner took the victim to Calmette Hospital for emergency treatment. After the action, the suspect jumped the gate and ran away. Until December 26, 2021, the victim died in the hospital.
Currently, the Criminal Police Department is sending the suspects for questioning at the Criminal Police Department to proceed with the procedure.
