The head of the local working group said that Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party, has never forgotten the Cambodian people, especially in liberating the country from the genocidal regime of the Khmer Rouge, building and developing the country as well. Seek peace for the Cambodian nation through a win-win policy, unite the Khmer people under one roof, and truly protected the peace completely without war.
