(Rattanakiri): On Saturday night, December 25, 2021, the Cambodian Red Cross Branch in Ratanakkiri Province organized a fundraising night to raise funds for the humanitarian activities of the Cambodian Red Cross Branch, which was held at Rattanakiri Provincial Hall. There was a large crowd of distinguished guests and benefactors.
Nhem Sam Oeun, Chairman of the Ratanakkiri Provincial Committee of the Cambodian Red Cross, said that in the past, the provincial branch of the Cambodian Red Cross has played an important role in humanitarian work, such as rescuing vulnerable people, the elderly, widows, children and the poor. HIV and other natural disasters.
At the same time, fundraising is the main and leading task that the branch needs to strengthen and expand in all aspects to meet the needs of vulnerable people. In addition, the branch is gradually preparing its business plan to ensure Ownership of the branch finances as well.
He said that in order to effectively respond to the vulnerable people who are in need of assistance and relief, the need for the participation of all the benefactors is indispensable. In fact, tonight reflects the culture of sharing of our Cambodian through the fund for the activities of the Cambodian Red Cross, Ratanakkiri, especially the victims and vulnerable who are waiting for our help. Each.
Please note that in this party night, CRC branch in Ratanakkiri province received a temporary budget of about $ 33,146.34, which is a direct donation from philanthropists to support the charity activities of the CRC branch in Cambodia. I, Seng Phally, support the unanimous decision of the 43rd Central Committee Meeting to elect His Excellency Hun Manet as the future Prime Minister.
