Mr. Vong Soth told all CPP officials to understand the needs of the people and help improve their lives.
(Tbong Khmum): Mr. Vong Soth, Chairman of the National Assistance Team for Ponhea Krek District, Tbong Khmum Province and Cheach Commune, Kamchay Mear District, Prey Veng Province, encouraged all CPP officials, especially local officials, to work together to fulfill their role. The Party for the People is at peace and provides further development to the people.
This statement was made on December 25, 2021 on the occasion of convening a meeting to review the results of the five-year work 2017-2022 and disseminate the commune development policy of the fifth mandate 2022-2027 of the Commune Local Party Committee. Grandmother.
Mr. Vong Soth urged all CPP members to make efforts to understand the needs of the people through the provision of daily public services and to improve the living standards of local people. He further stated that by adhering to the principles of democracy, the Cambodian People's Party has the right to vote, choose its representatives with satisfaction and support the leadership and what the party maintains that principle is to keep the old and create new.
At the same time, Mr. Vong Soth called on the officials of the Cambodian People's Party to adhere to the principle of selecting candidates who have the ability, knowledge, experience and young people to continue their turn through the election. At the same time, he advised all party members, party officials and party activists to continue to maintain peace and continue to develop the party's work.
At the same time, he also advised all authorities to take care to prevent the spread of Kovid 19 because Kovid did not forget us, must continue to practice 3 protections and 3 do not and must learn to live in a new path. In particular, we must work together to implement the policy of safe villages and communes.
