Nearly 100 Poor Students Preparing for High School Diploma Examination Receive Funding from Stung Sen Municipality, Kampong Thom Province
(Kampong Thom): While the day of high school diploma exam will be held on December 27, 2021, 91 poor students in Stung Sen city, Kampong Thom province received financial support from municipal authorities as an incentive to use during Necessity of their examination.
The handover and meeting ceremony for the 91 poor students was held on the afternoon of December 24, 2021 yesterday in the presence of Mr. Mak Bunhong, Governor of Stung Sen City.
On this occasion, the mayor said that the high school exam for high school graduates is the most important day to measure the ability of all students to study hard.
He continued that education can not use money, gold, money to buy knowledge from teachers! Therefore, only by striving to learn on your own can you gain true knowledge.
At the same time, the mayor confirmed that the students also mentioned that this school year (2020-2021) received less knowledge from teachers than previous years because the online study (Online) has some problems, but The students are still happy that the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports is launching a high school exam to gauge their abilities.
