Mr. Kao Thach conveyed the greetings from Dr. Aun Porn Moniroth, Deputy Prime Minister to all the young people present on this occasion.
He took this opportunity to socialize and visit and introduce work to all young people:
1: Continue to encourage young people to work for the party and continue to expand local party members and continue to respect the cause of the party and participate in disseminating the achievements of the party.
2: Reminisce about the bitter history of the hardships of oppression during the French colonial period, the historical stages in each era and the history of the Cambodian People's Party and the struggles of the CPP leaders that he Sacrificing fresh flesh and blood to exchange for the right cause for the people, society and peace.
3. Highlight the internal destruction of the three-year, eight-month genocide and the day when Cambodia was completely destroyed, including its human resources. However, due to the struggle of the CPP leadership, especially under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, he sacrificed his life by putting his life as a capital in exchange for the word "peace" for the whole people.
5. To remind about the main policies of the party, including: people, water, electricity, roads, in which he explained each principle to the youth to know more.
6: Continue to share good experiences related to the effective implementation of practical work.
7: Continue to encourage all of you, in addition to the duty to help the party, you must participate in promoting social work, especially on cleaning the environment, planting trees in public places, such as schools and pagodas to keep. It is in the best interest of the society and a good example for the people in its locality.
8: Explain the structure and mode of work of the youth of the Cambodian People's Party from the grassroots to the middle level.
