Sihanoukville Police Arrest Two Chinese in Attempted Kidnapping of Golden Sand Hotel and Casino Manager
On December 23, 2021, at 13:20, two Chinese suspects went to meet the manager of the Golden Sands Hotel and Casino in front of the Golden Sands Hotel and Casino. Village 4, Sangkat 4, Preah Sihanouk Province.
Seeing the unfortunate situation, the suspect, JIANG FENG, pulled out his pistol and fired at the security guard and staff of the Golden Sands Casino Hotel, injuring a Chinese security guard in the abdomen, then snatching the bullet inside. The two suspects escaped.
Immediately after receiving this information, the Criminal Police Planning Task Force, in cooperation with the Sihanoukville Police Inspectorate, arrived at the scene to conduct a thorough search until 2:30 p.m. One suspect, BAO JIE, and another, JIANG FENG, escaped with a pistol.
For the above suspects, the light criminal police office is building a case to be sent to the Sihanoukville Provincial Court to be punished according to the law.
