Interior Ministry spokesman: 38 people arrested for criminal and drug offenses on December 24
(Phnom Penh): At least 38 suspects were arrested in criminal and drug offenses across Cambodia on December 24, 2021 yesterday. This was confirmed by General Khieu Sopheak, spokesman for the Ministry of Interior, to Fresh News this morning, December 25.
General Khieu Sopheak added that of the 38 suspects, 21 were arrested in 13 criminal cases and 17 were arrested in 10 drug cases.
