In addition to inspecting the general work of vaccination at health centers, Ms. O Vandin also met and instructed on health care, especially protection against Kovid 19 and the benefits of vaccination to people in Basic as well.
The locations that Ms. O Vandin led the team to visit are: in Saang district, there are Prek Ambel health center, Saang Phnom health center, Kraing Yov health center. In Kien Svay district, there are Svay Rolum Health Center, Samrong Thom Health Center and Kien Svay District Referral Hospital.
In connection with the vaccination work for the people, Ms. O Vandin advised all doctors to continue to focus on vaccinating the people, especially those who have not given all the basic doses must be encouraged to accept. Give this base dose to everyone. In particular, for those who reach the time limit, the third dose or boost dose should also be given.
In particular, for the meeting with the people, Ms. O Vandin never forgot to remind the value of vaccination against Kovid 19. She claims that, of course, the Kovid 19 vaccine can protect an individual from all forms of the disease and, in some cases, does not progress to a serious condition.
She also called on all citizens to be friends with the vaccine, not to be hostile to the vaccine, and for those who have not yet received all the basic doses, must hurry to get vaccinated. Everyone is in a permanent location, especially at a health facility.
In addition, Ms. O Vandin also informed the people about the new development of Kovid 19 disease, especially the new mutants Omikrong, which is spreading to more than 100 countries in just one month. She said that in order to prevent the transmission of all 19 types of measles, it is necessary to strictly adhere to the "3 preventive and 3 contraceptive" rules, as well as the full dose of the vaccine.
