The Ministry of Public Works and Transport (MPWT) said that after conducting a search of the vehicle registration automation system and reviewing the relevant documents, it was found that the Hyundai Venue was registered with a legal license plate in 2021. The Lexus NX 200t, on the other hand, uses fake license plates, contrary to the content of the Road Traffic Law and the Sub-Decree on Registration, Provision of Vehicle Identification and Equipping of Vehicle License Plates.
In this clarification, the Ministry of Public Works and Transport also informed that the registration of vehicles of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport is done through the automation system, the automatic authentication process ensures that there is no duplicate license plate registration or Vehicles are registered free of import duties and have a QR Code for scanning and verifying the public registration number on the license plate and vehicle identification card.
In order to know whether the vehicle is registered with the correct or fake QR Code, the Ministry requests the public and the media to understand and disseminate the notification dated September 25, 2017 on how to verify the correctness of the vehicle license. Vehicles, certificates and inspection certificates of vehicles and vehicle license plates have QR Code.
The Ministry of Public Works and Transport (MPWT) has announced that it, together with the relevant authorities, will continue to promote the dissemination of relevant law enforcement authorities and the public on how to verify the accuracy of all documents related to vehicles and driver's licenses to reduce and eliminate Falsification of public documents and ensuring security and social order, especially protecting citizens from vulnerabilities by corrupt groups or individuals.
The Ministry has called on all citizens to get their vehicles registered with license plates before using them and to avoid using vehicles without registration with legal license plates or license plates. Fake like the case above.
Mr. Thong Khon Sends Congratulatory Message to Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh and Lok Chumteav Honorary Doctor Dr. Men Sam An, Elected Vice President of the 43rd Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party |
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, will preside over the opening ceremony of the "Samdech Techo Prime Minister's Award" golf tournament on Saturday, December 25, 2021. At Vattanac Golf Resort Golf Course.
Tomorrow's golf tournament is jointly organized by the Ministry of Tourism, the General Commission of the National Police, the Golf Federation of Cambodia and the Vattanac Golf Resort Golf Course. The competition was held to celebrate the 23rd anniversary of the Victory-Monument (29 December 1998-29 December 2021) of the end of the Cambodian Civil War and the successful implementation of Samdech's win-win policy. Techo Hun Sen, Founder Ek.
The organization of this golf event is not only a reminder of the achievement of complete peace in Cambodia through Samdech Techo's win-win policy, but also to strengthen the friendship between the fans of the sport. Golf, too. In addition, this competition is also to strengthen the ability of Cambodian golfers to head to the 2023 SEA Games, which Cambodia will host.
