Siem Reap Hosts Global New Year Event in Changkar Roi Community Forest and Urban
(Siem Reap): Siem Reap Provincial Authority is organizing the Global New Year 2021 to 2022 in two locations, the first in the community forest of Changkran Roi in Varin district and in Siem Reap to promote another potential natural tourism destination in addition to the temple.
Mr. Lay Kimsour, Honorary President of the Young Entrepreneurs Association of Siem Reap Branch, described that according to the current situation, the trend of Cambodian people to travel has increased, but due to Kovid-19, the situation of travel has also changed. Therefore, Phnom Changkran Roi is an ecotourism area that attracts a lot of national and international visitors.
In addition to the community tourism area, the provincial administration also plans to hold a Global New Year celebration in Siem Reap. The Royal Garden is the destination and there is also a food fair.
