Through Facebook, Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh said: "Today, I have the great honor that the 43rd Central Committee Meeting of the 5th Mandate of the Cambodian People's Party has the confidence to nominate me as Vice President of the party.
Samdech continued: "As the Vice President of the Party, I would like to make all kinds of sacrifices to continue to strengthen the unity within the party to be strong and sustainable in order to achieve absolute success in the Commune / Sangkat Council elections. The fifth mandate in 2022, the national election, the seventh legislature in 2023 and the subsequent mandate election.
It should be noted that Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh and Mrs. Kittisangkhab Dr. Men Sam An were elected as the Vice President of the Cambodian People's Party by the 43rd Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party on the morning of December 24, 2021.
