From ancient times to the present, after the Eastern Jing Dynasty, the Southern Song Dynasty, the Southern Qi Dynasty, the Southern Liang Dynasty, the Southern Tang Dynasty, the Meng Dynasty, and the People's Republic of China established the capital / capital of Nanjing for a total of 455. The year is historically named the "Ancient Capital of 10 Dynasties".
