(Phnom Penh): The 35-storey Administration Building of the General Department of Customs and Excise of Cambodia was officially inaugurated on Thursday, December 23, 2021 under the high presidency of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia.
On the occasion of the inauguration of this building, Samdech Techo Hun Sen delivered a speech for about 1 hour and 40 minutes. The following are the main contents of Samdech Techo:
In the words of the conversation, Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that it was a good opportunity for Phirun to cool the carpet in the early morning.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the current location of the Administration Building of the General Department of Customs and Excise is a dilapidated location.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that the three buildings of the General Department of Customs and Excise of Cambodia cost more than $ 50 million.
* This year marks the 70th anniversary of the establishment of the Cambodian Customs and Excise Department.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen commemorates the many achievements of His Majesty King Norodom Sihanouk in the Royal Crusade to demand independence from Cambodia from France and to build a national society.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praised the wisdom and crusade of His Majesty King Norodom Sihanouk, who used his intellect to demand independence without the use of armed force.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that without the royal crusade of Samdech Norodom Sihanouk, perhaps Cambodia would still be a territory under French rule.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the customs institution after the overthrow of the genocidal regime was proposed to be re-established by Mr. Taing Sarin, Minister of Commerce during the Cambodian state.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praised Mr. Tang Sarin for his vision on the organization of ministries and state institutions.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in 2004, foreign friends suggested that Cambodia sell its customs institution. Samdech Techo emphasized that this opinion is to sell the national sovereignty of Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that at that time, if Samdech did not change his institutional protection, Cambodia would lose up to 50 percent of its revenue.
* Samdech Techo stated that because Samdech stubbornly defended this national sovereignty, some foreigners did not like Samdech.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the inauguration of the Customs Administration Building this morning is a testament to the modernization of Cambodia's customs sector.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he would postpone Kun Nhim's retirement until 2025 in order to modernize the customs institution.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that although Samdech resigned as Prime Minister, Mr. Aun Porn Moniroth still retains the position of Deputy Prime Minister as Minister of Economy and Finance.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his satisfaction with the establishment of the National Customs School, which is to help train the ability of Cambodian children on customs.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that all the national achievements that the Royal Government is doing now are to be a legacy for the next generation of Cambodian children.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the report on tax revenue, customs and treasury must be sent to Samdech every day. Samdech Techo stated that revenue management is very important for national management.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that tax and customs revenue is more than 4 billion dollars for 2021. This revenue fell a lot compared to before there was 19 Kovid, but can help Cambodia control the expenditure situation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praises Keat Chhun as an excellent human trainer.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he spends more than $ 30 million a month to feed the people affected by the Kovid 19 crisis.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen asks the Minister of Economy and the Ministry of Health to consider providing a fourth dose to doctors.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen revealed that during the outbreak of Kovid 19, more than 400 of Samdech's bodyguards gave birth to Kovid 19. But after vaccination to prevent the spread.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that there was a request to change the version of Bakdup students in the provinces, but Samdech rejected it.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to call for joint efforts to prevent the spread of Kovid 19 through the implementation of health measures and vaccinations.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen requested the Armed Forces to cooperate with the Customs Administration to prevent tax evasion.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen requests for understanding and tolerance from civil servants and the armed forces for the inability to increase salaries until 2022.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen commended all leaders and customs officials for their tax collection efforts.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reacts to the allegations made by Kasit Phearum and others about his visit to Myanmar.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen asked the respondents whether the country had severed diplomatic ties with Myanmar.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Cambodian ambassador is still present in Myanmar, so his visit to Myanmar is not wrong.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that ASEAN, which has only 9 members, is not enough water, so Samdech will try to make ASEAN 10 members again.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that most of those who reacted to Samdech's story to Myanmar were opposition groups.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed hope that ASEAN member countries, partners and observers in Myanmar will understand the efforts to resolve ASEAN issues.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen asked for time to work on the issues of ASEAN and Myanmar should not react immediately.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that those who obstructed Samdech's visit to Myanmar were destroying ASEAN.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he was not angry with the reaction of the people of Myanmar to his visit, but that they would benefit in return for political stability in the country.
