Duke Kith Meng and his wife pay a courtesy call on Dr. Hun Manet and Mrs. Pech Chanmony at their home
(Phnom Penh): Oknha Kith Meng, President of the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce and Chairman of the Board of Directors of Royal Group, his wife and four children on the afternoon of December 22, 2021, paid a courtesy call and paid a courtesy call. Dr. Hun Manet, Deputy Commander of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces and Commander of the Army, and his wife, Mrs. Pech Chanmony, were at home.
