Mr. Vongsey Visoth Presented 3 Cambodian Entrepreneur Awards 2021, Entrepreneurship Award, Cambodian Entrepreneur Award in New Business and Cambodian Young Entrepreneur Award
(Phnom Penh): Cambodian Entrepreneurs, an institution established by the Ministry of Economy and Finance, on the night of December 21, 2021, organized the "Cambodian Entrepreneur Awards 2021" at Sofitel Phnom Penh Phokitra Hotel under the chairmanship of Mr. Vongsey Visoth, Minister The Prime Minister is the Permanent Secretary of the Ministry of Economy and Finance and Chairman of the Board of Governors of the Entrepreneurship Development Fund.
Mr. Vongsy Visoth said that Samdech Techo Hun Sen has a long-term vision to build and promote entrepreneurship in leading the private sector, which is a partner in the development of the Royal Government and a driving force in driving national economic growth.
The “Cambodian Young Entrepreneurs Award” (SME Awards) consists of 5 awards in collaboration with the Young Entrepreneurs Association of Cambodia (YEAC) with the aim of creating a conducive environment for further publicity of the business, networking with investment partners Operational procedures and compliance that support the growth of small and medium enterprises.
Dr. Chheang Vann Monin, Executive Director of Cambodian Entrepreneurship, said, “Cambodian Entrepreneurs have a vision to become a national nursery in promoting the entrepreneurial ecosystem in all regions of Cambodia to cover and expand all types of entrepreneurs to increase the new generation of entrepreneurs who will replace or More human resources to create more new businesses.
The whole program ended with the participation of distinguished guests from both public and private sectors. It should also be noted that Cambodian Entrepreneurs was the first institution to organize all three types of entrepreneurship promotion programs during the 19 19 Kovid Crisis in one year and completed and completed at the same time.
