Looking at the Techo Heritage National Stadium, the whole shape is like a ship, this shape means that the traditional friendship between China and Cambodia is long-lasting, and the comprehensive strategic partnership between China and Cambodia and the common destiny between China and Cambodia. Cambodia will have a better future.
To the north and south of the stadium are 99-meter-high pillars that form the image of Cambodia "raising his hands in salute". The outer walls of the stadium are decorated with romduol flowers. Chinese technology and Cambodian culture are integrated in this stadium, which is a friendly connection between China and Cambodia.
