(Tbong Khmum): 116 former CNRP activists in Memot district, Tbong Khmum province, continued to volunteer to join the political life of the Cambodian People's Party when the opposition party was dissolved by the Supreme Court. And after they have clearly understood the policies and actions of the good deeds of the leaders of the Cambodian People's Party.
The induction ceremony was held on the afternoon of December 22, 2021, presided over by Dr. Cheam Chansophorn, Member of the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party and Vice Chairman of the CPP Committee of Tbong Khmum Province. The 116 former opposition party activists who have just announced their new entry are from five communes: Chan Moul commune, Kampang commune, Choam commune, Memong commune and Memot commune.
On that occasion, Dr. Cheam Chansophoan on behalf of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party and on behalf of Deputy Prime Minister Chea Sophara, Deputy Chairman of the National Working Group for Tbong Khmum Province and Chairman of the National Working Group for Memot District Speech with a warm welcome to the members who have just entered the political life with the Cambodian People's Party at this time.
Dr. stated that to join the CPP wholeheartedly is to provide justice to the CPP, which has struggled in the national cause and brought peace to the people to live as comfortably as today. . And the participation of all of you will make the CPP more supportive for the development of the commune.
Dr. stated that the policy of the Cambodian People's Party is only for national unification, protection of independence, national sovereignty, territorial integrity, unlike the former opposition party, which has a separatist view that leads to chaos in Cambodian society through incitement. Color and racism.
On that occasion, Dr. Cheam Chansophoan also informed the members of the Cambodian People's Party that the current political situation in Cambodia is better, the people have been celebrating the current peace and normalcy. The lives of the people are in the sense that Cambodia today is not what the opposition is polluting and exaggerating.
At the same time, Dr. Cheam Chansophoan also instructed the members, both old and new, to have good internal unity to continue to support Samdech Techo Hun Sen as the Prime Minister of Cambodia in all terms.
