The purpose of this training is to further strengthen the capacity of civil servants and staff working in tourism information centers to manage the operation of tourist information centers and increase the capacity of hospitality services to be more efficient and to prepare for the 40th ASEAN Tourism Forum in Sihanoukville, which is scheduled to be held in January 2022.
