According to the Border Police Officer, under the direct command of Major General Huot Sothy, Oddar Meanchey Provincial Police Commissioner, and Brigadier General Hang Bo, Deputy Commissioner of the Land Border Protection Police of the Provincial Police, patrolled the area 24 hours a day. 24 hours by taking turns to prevent workers from crossing the border illegally.
In fact, on December 20, 2021, at the target point No. 17, O Khla Khmum corridor in Sangkat O Smach, Samrong City, the Border Police Force No. 702 arrested a suspect named Phok Narith (aka Kling), 54 years old. The mastermind of bringing illegal migrant workers actively resides in O Khla Khmum village, Sangkat O Smach, Samrong city, Oddar Meanchey province.
The suspect is currently being taken to the provincial police for questioning and to build a case to be sent to court for legal proceedings.
